ction with an allowed no-activity line, and Inbox says Nothing needs action without a stale qualification. Independently reproduced with a contract-valid one-hour-old healthy-empty overview, fresh=false and face=gap. This regresses C12'\\''s explicit requirement that expired sources remain distinct from healthy empty, retained by the parity matrix and selected architecture. Acceptance: preserve cached data but identify its stale coverage on Home and Inbox; tests must cross the core freshness deadline, including returning to a cached tenant, and distinguish fresh healthy-empty, expired, partial and failed states without silently refreshing.\"],\"blockers\":[\"B1 — C30 requires C29. C29 attempt-06 still recommends fail with a blocker for its mandatory Vulture management verification; its verdict hash matches the receipt, and docs/planning/evidence/C29/live/blocked.json confirms nothing was run. D058 permits P09 progress while C26 is open but does not waive C29'\\''s mandatory evidence. C30 cannot complete until the predecessor blocker is resolved and C29 obtains the required passing review/completion.\"],\"evidence_gaps\":[\"E1 — The required predecessor live read-only wizard verification against Vulture remains absent (docs/planning/chunks/C29.md; docs/planning/evidence/C29/live/blocked.json and live-scope-request.md). Closure requires owner-designated management-verification scope, the actual authorized run, redacted source-bound evidence and C29 re-review. C30'\\''s synthetic acceptance does not substitute for it.\"],\"optional_suggestions\":[\"Extend delayed-notification coverage to deliver an outcome only after returning A→B→A in a new context. Toast insertion/rendering currently checks tenant rather than the originating context, unlike unconfirmed deliveries. A scripted-snapshot probe produced the old refusal in A'\\''s new context; native reachability through the serialized DesktopClient admission path was not established, so this is not scored as an authority 